usage: prepare_inputs.py [-h] --work-dir WORK_DIR --output-apk OUTPUT_APK
                         --evidence EVIDENCE [--installer INSTALLER]
                         [--innoextract INNOEXTRACT]
                         [--download-timeout DOWNLOAD_TIMEOUT]

Prepare the exact signed KaM APK using official data and a code-only template.
Downloads the public installer (never executes it), extracts files with
innoextract, and invokes the hash-checked reconstruction. No Android is
started.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --work-dir WORK_DIR
  --output-apk OUTPUT_APK
  --evidence EVIDENCE
  --installer INSTALLER
                        Existing pinned official installer, for an offline
                        repeat
  --innoextract INNOEXTRACT
  --download-timeout DOWNLOAD_TIMEOUT
